      "title": "feat(desktop): add desktop uninstall and legacy LXQt cleanup",
      "summary": "Adds retryable desktop uninstall and legacy LXQt cleanup that preserve user data and shared dependencies, verified on Thor through interruption/retry, 604 MiB reclaimed, Steam/melonDS launches and KDE reinstall, with 437 Android tests and the Linux tool suite passing.",
